{{!
    @template mod_these/bullet_list

    Liste à puces, au balisage de html_writer::alist().

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * items Éléments : parts (fragments de mod_these/part).

    Example context (json):
    {"items": [{"parts": [{"ptext": {"value": "Fiche de sujet — dépôt"}, "phtml": false, "pstrong": false, "pstronghtml": false, "pem": false, "pbadge": false, "pspan": false, "plink": false, "pmuted": false, "pbr": false, "pfiles": false, "pstatus": false, "pdetails": false, "pcode": false, "pcheckbox": false}]}]}
}}
<ul>
{{#items}}
<li>{{#parts}}{{> mod_these/part}}{{/parts}}</li>
{{/items}}
</ul>
